<title>BELGIUM: Belgium liquidity little changed at money tender.</title>
<headline>Belgium liquidity little changed at money tender.</headline>
<dateline>BRUSSELS 1997-06-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Belgian central bank gave the following details on its fixed-rate tender for seven-day advances -</p>
<p>    Value date 02/07	  expiry on 09/07    NBVA</p>
<p>    Amount allotted	   15.000 bln bfr    (15.025 bln *)</p>
<p>    Interest rate	     3.00 pct	    (3.00 pct **)</p>
<p>    Total amount of bids    145.275 bln bfr</p>
<p>Percentage of bids accepted  10.18 pct</p>
<p>* amount draining from the money market on July 2</p>
<p>** interest rate at previous tender on June 23</p>
<p>-- Brussels Newsroom +32 2 287 6810, Fax +32 2 230 7710</p>
